    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'The <b>Game Mode Manager</b> is a NetworkObject that checks for all <b>IGameMode</b> interfaces that exist as siblings to this object in the hierarchy (i.e. sharing a parent).


      <b>Note:</b> <i>If you plan to use this template''s <b>Game Mode</b> systems; this prefab, or a variant / override of this, must be in your scene</i>'
