  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>Chess Game Mode</b> is a fully functional chess game based on a traditional chess ruleset. This game mode supports both solo and vs AI.

      This game mode shows an example of an additively loaded game mode, so changing modes will erase any progress made during the chess game.'
