  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'The MR Multiplayer Template makes it really easy to create different Game Modes. Utilize the IGameMode interface and see how some of the examples are done.


      We have examples for both <b>Scene Based</b> and <b>Additively Loaded</b> modes.'
